SQL> 
SQL> -- Un REVOKE par colonne est refuse (ORA-01750) : on revoque UPDATE sur toute la table.
SQL> REVOKE UPDATE ON rh.employes FROM omar;

Revoke succeeded.

SQL> 
SQL> PROMPT === DBA_COL_PRIVS pour OMAR apres revocation ===
=== DBA_COL_PRIVS pour OMAR apres revocation ===
SQL> COLUMN owner FORMAT A8
SQL> COLUMN table_name FORMAT A16
SQL> COLUMN column_name FORMAT A14
SQL> COLUMN privilege FORMAT A10
SQL> COLUMN grantee FORMAT A10
SQL> SELECT owner, table_name, column_name, privilege, grantee
